SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub_Text_MeetChairman:
	.string "Er-hem! I am the CHAIRMAN of the\n"
	.string "POKéMON FAN CLUB!\p"
	.string "As CHAIRMAN, I am naturally the most\n"
	.string "important person in the room!\p"
	.string "Nobody raises POKéMON like I do.\n"
	.string "Nobody!\p"
	.string "Let me tell you about POKéMON\n"
	.string "CONTESTS.\p"
	.string "You show off your POKéMON for the\n"
	.string "whole world to see!\p"
	.string "But they're held in far-off towns, and\n"
	.string "my knees don't travel.\p"
	.string "So we gather here to show off our\n"
	.string "POKéMON instead. And to judge yours.$"

SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub_Text_LikeToSeeEnteredContestPokemon:
	.string "The POKéMON of a TRAINER who has\n"
	.string "entered a CONTEST… That, I would like\l"
	.string "to see.$"

SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub_Text_AllowMeToExamineYourPokemon:
	.string "Er-hem! You've entered a POKéMON\n"
	.string "CONTEST, I see!\p"
	.string "Please! Allow me to examine how you\n"
	.string "raised your POKéMON.\p"
	.string "Nothing delights me more than POKéMON\n"
	.string "raised by others.\p"
	.string "The happy faces of well-kept POKéMON…\p"
	.string "The kind eyes of the TRAINER who raised\n"
	.string "them…\p"
	.string "It fills my heart until it nearly bursts.\n"
	.string "My doctor says that's bad.\p"
	.string "Oh! Forgive me for rambling!\p"
	.string "Please! Let me see how much your\n"
	.string "POKéMON has grown!$"

SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub_Text_HowIsYourPokemonGrowing:
	.string "How is your POKéMON growing? Let me\n"
	.string "examine it.$"

SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub_Text_HmHmISee:
	.string "Hm, hm… I see… Hm.$"

SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub_Text_GiveMonMorePokeblocks:
	.string "Hmmm… Not bad. Not good either.\n"
	.string "Mediocre.\p"
	.string "You, the TRAINER, must put in more\n"
	.string "effort!\p"
	.string "May I suggest more {POKEBLOCK}S? It looks hungry.$"

SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub_Text_NoSpaceForReward:
	.string "Oh, my…\p"
	.string "Your POKéMON deserves a reward.\p"
	.string "But your BAG is full. Of junk, probably.$"

SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub_Text_MonMostImpressiveGiveItThis:
	.string "Your {STR_VAR_1} is growing most\n"
	.string "impressively! A fine specimen!\p"
	.string "But! With this, it'd be even better!\n"
	.string "Indeed!$"

SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub_Text_ExplainRedScarf:
	.string "Let a POKéMON hold that RED SCARF.\p"
	.string "Everyone will see how cool it is. Even\n"
	.string "the ones who don't care.$"

SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub_Text_ExplainBlueScarf:
	.string "Let a POKéMON hold that BLUE SCARF.\p"
	.string "Its beauty will be off the charts!$"

SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub_Text_ExplainPinkScarf:
	.string "Let a POKéMON hold that PINK SCARF.\p"
	.string "Maximum cuteness. Dangerous levels.$"

SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub_Text_ExplainGreenScarf:
	.string "Let a POKéMON hold that GREEN SCARF.\p"
	.string "It will look smarter. Looking smart is\n"
	.string "half the job.$"

SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub_Text_ExplainYellowScarf:
	.string "Let a POKéMON hold that YELLOW SCARF.\p"
	.string "It will look tougher! Like a\n"
	.string "construction worker!$"

SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub_Text_NothingElseToGiveYou:
	.string "Sorry, I've got nothing left to give\n"
	.string "you! Nothing at all!\p"
	.string "You're blessed with the gift of raising\n"
	.string "POKéMON without items! Or you just took\l"
	.string "all of mine.$"

SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub_Text_ShowMePokemonThatLoveYou:
	.string "I love seeing POKéMON that love their\n"
	.string "TRAINERS.\p"
	.string "POKéMON feel what their TRAINERS feel.\p"
	.string "Treat them with love and care, and\n"
	.string "they'll love you back.\p"
	.string "When yours adores you, come show me.\n"
	.string "I'll cry. I always cry.$"

SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub_Text_PokemonAdoresYou:
	.string "Your POKéMON really adores you. I'm\n"
	.string "crying.\p"
	.string "For such a caring TRAINER, a gift from\n"
	.string "the FAN CLUB!$"

SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub_Text_TreatPokemonWithLove:
	.string "POKéMON feel what their TRAINERS feel.\p"
	.string "Treat them with love and care, and\n"
	.string "they'll love you back. Unlike my ex.$"

SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub_Text_PokemonDontLikeFainting:
	.string "If your POKéMON keeps fainting, it'll\n"
	.string "start to resent you.\p"
	.string "Mine is writing a letter to a lawyer.$"

SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub_Text_MonEnjoyedProtein:
	.string "Do POKéMON like items used on them?\p"
	.string "Mine loved PROTEIN.\p"
	.string "Now it goes to the gym without me.$"

SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub_Text_Skitty:
	.string "SKITTY: Fffnyaaaah…$"

SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub_Text_Zigzagoon:
	.string "ZIGZAGOON: Kyuuu…$"

SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub_Text_Azumarill:
	.string "AZUMARILL: Marimari?$"

